        {
          "kind": "class",
          "description": "Text field with a suggestion list. Form-associated: `name` submits `value`, a form reset restores the value from connection, and a disabled fieldset disables the control. While typing, `value` is the field text. Choosing an option sets `value` to that option's `value` and shows its `label` in the field. A string that matches no option stays, and the field shows that string. This element does not filter options. `input` bubbles and is composed. While typing it is the inner input event, after `value` updates. Choosing an option dispatches `input` and `change` on this host. Both bubble and are composed. Enter selects the highlighted option while the list is open, and submits the parent form when it is closed. A clear button shows while `value` is non-empty. It sets `value` to an empty string and dispatches `input` and `change`. No public methods. `ui-form-field` writes `description`, `described-by`, `invalid`, and `required`.",
